+#### Milestone 0.3.2: Accessibility Engine Hardening & Binder Safety
+- [ ] **In-Memory Schedule Caching:** Eliminate reflection-based `Gson().fromJson()` deserialization on the Main Binder Thread during `onAccessibilityEvent` in `AmniShieldAccessibilityService.kt` and `SavedPreferencesLoader.kt`.
+- [ ] **Polling Decoupling:** Eliminate continuous `rootInActiveWindow` queries on 1-second and 2-second Handler timers in `ReelsSessionTracker.kt` and `BrowserSessionTracker.kt`, transitioning to event-driven state checks.
+- [ ] **Node Traversal Exception Safety:** Implement robust `try ... finally` blocks and null-safe node recycling across `AntiUninstallDetector.kt` and `ReelDetectionEngine.kt`.
+- [ ] **Manifest Security Hardening:** Set `android:exported="false"` on `LauncherActivity` in `AndroidManifest.xml` (line 76) to prevent unauthorized external intent launching.
+
+#### Milestone 0.3.3: Store Compliance & Layout Resilience
+- [ ] **Prominent Disclosure Overhaul:** Implement scrollable container and adaptive sizing for the accessibility prominent disclosure dialog to ensure compliance in landscape orientation and 200% font scaling.
+- [ ] **Persistent Affirmative Consent:** Persist the accessibility disclosure acceptance timestamp and version flag in `SharedPreferences` to guarantee auditability.
+- [ ] **Screen Rotation State Preservation:** Add `rememberSaveable` state handling in `AmniSpaceActivity.kt`, implement `onSaveInstanceState` in `WarningActivity.kt`, and dynamically adapt window insets in `UsageStatOverlayManager.kt`.
+
+#### Milestone 0.3.4: Dual-Host Cleanup & Navigation Decoupling
+- [ ] **Type-Safe Intent Routing:** Implement a sealed route contract between `MainActivity.kt` and `FragmentActivity.kt`, replacing loosely-typed string extras (`feature_type`, `fragment`).
+- [ ] **SharedPreferences Synchronization Lock:** Implement mutex synchronization locks in `SavedPreferencesLoader.kt` to prevent concurrent multi-threaded read/write file races.
+- [ ] **Automated Multi-Flavor Matrix Testing:** Expand CI GitHub Actions to run automated instrumented UI tests across `playstoreDebug`, `fdroidDebug`, and `universalDebug`.
+
+#### Milestone 0.3.5: Pure Compose & Storage Architecture Epic (Prep for V1.0)
+- [ ] **Room & DataStore Migration Epic:** Formalize a phased migration path from the 29+ SharedPreferences XML files to Room DB (relational blocking rules) and Preferences DataStore (flags and tokens).
+- [ ] **Pure-Compose Navigation Epic:** Reconnect and finalize `AmniShieldAdaptiveApp.kt` using modern Compose Navigation 2.8+, safely retiring the dual-host split (`MainActivity.kt` + `FragmentActivity.kt`).
 
